  "name": "rrtm_couple_heating_call1440_inputs",
  "description": "Mount-edge library of the RRTM longwave assembly for RRTMLWHeating at SCM call 1440: the fluxes come from RTRNSweep through the coupling-target parameters F_up_in/F_dn_in (model interfaces gathered by the assembly), while the column state (p8w, pi3d, t3d of tile column 0, dump scm_ref2_1440.json) is the dumped WRF column. Generated numbers, hand-authored structure.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "assembly-inputs",
   "coupling"
  ]
 },
